{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22847","headline":"霖雨苦多江湖暴涨块然独望因题北亭 · 白居易","name":"霖雨苦多江湖暴涨块然独望因题北亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自作浔阳客，无如苦雨何。\n阴昏晴日少，闲闷睡时多。\n湖阔将天合，云低与水和。\n篱根舟子语，巷口钓人歌。\n雾岛沈黄气，风帆蹙白波。\n门前车马道，一宿变江河。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}